ask(c,'For the sensor loop exactly as shown on p162, what is its final reading and action after the loop terminates?', ['0.4 and STOP','0.2 and STOP','0.8 and Reduce speed','1.5 and MOVE_FORWARD'], ['The first reading below0.5 is0.4, which sets STOP and breaks before0.2 is visited.','0.2 is never processed after the break.','The0.8 case continues rather than terminating.','The1.5 case does not terminate the loop.'],kind='algorithm_trace',steps=['2.0 and1.5 take MOVE_FORWARD.','0.8 takes Reduce speed, prints and continues.','0.4 sets STOP and breaks.','The post-loop print uses reading0.4 and actionSTOP.'],assumptions=['Execute the complete p162 loop exactly as visually transcribed; the print-call commas are present in the source.'])
